Fri Nov 13 19:20:00 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- version 0.23.1+git20261113175838.8f442ba-0
- Ship the upstream chrome-sandbox helper again: the previous revision
  excluded it from the /opt glob, which removed the SUID sandbox from
  the package instead of deduplicating the filelist. The file is now
  packaged once by the directory glob with its upstream mode 0755, and
  the post-install scriptlet raises it to 4755 only on kernels without
  unprivileged user namespaces (the same probe vesktop uses), so the
  packaged filelist stays rpm -V clean on Tumbleweed, Debian testing and
  sid.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Fri Nov 13 19:15:00 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- version 0.23.1+git20261113175838.8f442ba-0
- New upstream snapshot 8f442ba (base 0.23.1); the Debian recipe now
  names the same payload as the spec.
- BuildRequires hicolor-icon-theme so the icon directories are owned
  in the build root, and chrome-sandbox excluded from the /opt glob
  so it is listed exactly once.

